:"As the source of Fimbulwinter is the loss of the garou romancero in general and death of the Legendary Realm, stopping it would be beneficious to the world at large, not only for garou for the fae too.<br /> As the stories are remembered and the realm healed, the real world should be affected too as the old legends are tell again and glory days are bring back, the banality should recede a little and the flame will burn again in the hearts of the garou for the finals days. <br /> note: the W20 umbra book tell a different aproaching about the fimbulwinter, I like the revised version and my interpretation of it more.<br /> <br /> As for the Domains... <br /> I got a couple of those for the chronicle I'm running right now but I think that this is not the type of example you're lookin for: the Tomb of the last crowned king of Gaia and the Crisol.<br /> The first one is a hellish realm of caverns, glowing fungus, worms and flies, full of poison and decay in wich center lies the remmnants of the dead Wyrm and in wich eye lies the corpse of a rooster.<br /> The second one is the lite version of the Flux Realm as in my chronicle that realm don't exist anymore because was eated by question marks, an umbral caern made by a strange sect of Black Spirals.<br /> <br /> I hope I can inspire you a little and sorry for my grammar mistakes, sometimes is as I completely forget how to writte.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nosolorol.com/nuevo/images/Fostern.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1192-aura","name":"Aura","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T05:26:28-08:00","id":763970,"title":"","content":"Hows thi